OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FCloudy and
OL,6,Fdamp through the evening with the rain
OL,7,Fclearing away. Turning partly cloudy
OL,8,Fand dry overnight for most, with
OL,9,Fpatchy mist and fog developing. Winds
OL,10,Feasing away from the hills. Cold with
OL,11,Fa frost developing in sheltered areas.
OL,12,
OL,13,CSunday:FA cold and dry start for most,
OL,14,Fwith a band of blustery showers moving
OL,15,Finto western parts around midday.
OL,16,FRemaining drier and brighter
OL,17,Felsewhere. Breezy, with temperatures
OL,18,Fnear average.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
