OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FWindy
OL,6,Fwith cloudy periods on Monday and
OL,7,FTuesday, patchy rain at times,
OL,8,Fbecoming more widespread later. A wet
OL,9,Fstart to Wednesday but turning drier
OL,10,Fand brighter. Temperatures above
OL,11,Faverage.
